# Credential Synchronization & Secure Vault Rule

- Master vault is `/mnt/NewVolume/Personal_Projects/cred/credentials.json.gpg`.
- Always use `cred` or `/secure-cred-vault` with clearance PIN/passphrase to manage secrets.
- Always sync credentials and passwords directly to deployment environments (GitHub Secrets, Cloudflare Secrets, etc.) via memory piping (`gh secret set`, `wrangler secret put`).
- NEVER commit credentials or plaintext passwords to git or print them in terminal stdout/logs.
